  "content": "[Intro]\n[Am]\n[Dm7]\n[G]\n[Cmaj7]\n[F]\n[Bdim]\n[E]\n[Am]\n\n[Verse 1]\n[Am]I remember\nParis\n[Dm7]in fourty\nnine.\n[G]The Chams Ely-\nsee,\n[Cmaj7]Saint Michel and old Beau-\njolais wine.\n[F]And I re-\ncall\n[Bdim]that you where mine\n[E]In those\n[A]Parisienne ways.\n[D/A]\n[A]\n\n[Solo 1]\n[Dm7]\n[G]\n[Cmaj7]\n[F]\n[Bdim]\n[E]\n[Am]\nLooking\nback at the\n\n[Verse 2]\n[Dm7]pho to-\ngraph.\n[G]Those summer-\ndays spent\n[Cmaj7]outside corner\ncafes.\n[F]\nOh, I could\n[Bdim]write you para-\ngraph\n[B]About my\nold Parisienne\n[E]days.\n[F]\n[E]\n\n[Solo 2]\n[Dm7]\n[G]\n[Cmaj7]\n[F]\n[Bdim]\n[E]\n[Am]\n[Dm]\n[Am]\n[F]  [Em]\n\n[Solo 3 / Outro]\n[Am]\n[Dm]\n[Am]\n[F]  [Em]\n[Am]\n[Dm]\n[Am]\n[F]  [Em]\n[Am]\n[Dm]",
